WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:01.580
- [Instructor] What I
wanna do in this video

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:06.410
is try to figure out what
35 plus 22 plus 10 plus 16

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:08.330
is equal to.

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:11.893
So pause this video and see
if you can figure that out.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:15.490
All right, now let's work
through this together.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:19.700
Now, as you will learn, there's
many ways to approach this,

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.060
but the way I'll think about it

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:23.760
is by thinking about place value.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:27.210
For example, when we look at 35,

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:30.110
we have 3 tens and 5 ones.

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:33.530
3 tens, right over here,
that's the same thing as 30.

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:38.250
So you could view 35 as 30 plus 5.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:41.610
And we can do the same thing for 22.

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:46.430
22 is 2 tens, which is 20,
that's what that 2 tells us,

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:47.930
plus 2 ones.

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:49.930
So 20 plus 2.

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:54.080
And then we have 10, which
is just 1 ten and no ones.

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:55.690
So plus 10.

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:58.260
And then 16, we could rewrite that

00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:00.670
as being the same thing as 1 ten.

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:02.980
So 10 plus 6 ones,

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:05.010
plus 6 ones.

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:06.680
Now, why was this useful?

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:09.340
Now I could take all of the things

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:10.730
that are a certain number of tens,

00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:15.730
so 30, 20, 10, and 10, and
try to add those together.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:19.310
And then separately, I will try to add

00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:22.850
the 5, the 2, and the 6.

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:24.120
And when you see when I do it,

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:27.220
I think it'll make a little
more sense why it's useful.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:32.220
So, we have a 30 plus 20 plus 10 plus 10,

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:37.070
plus that purple 10,

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:38.730
plus that purple 10.

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:41.920
So I've already accounted
for the 30, the 20,

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:43.320
that 10 and that 10.

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:44.980
And then I'll have all of the things

00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:47.100
that were written in
the ones place before.

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:50.920
So plus 5 ones, so I
got that taken care of,

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:54.920
plus 2 ones, that's taken care of,

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:56.850
plus 6 ones,

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:58.840
plus 6 ones.

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:01.940
And now all of these we can think about.

00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:03.950
What is 30 plus 20?

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:07.040
Well, 30 plus 20 is going to be 50,

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:09.410
and then 50 plus 10 is 60,

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:12.520
and then 60 plus 10 is 70.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:14.190
So that's all going to be 70.

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:15.220
Another way to think about it

00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:19.590
is we have 3 tens plus 2
tens plus 1 ten plus 1 ten.

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:24.250
3 plus 2 plus 1 plus 1
is 7, so we have 7 tens.

00:02:25.190 --> 00:02:27.360
And you actually saw that up here as well,

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:32.360
3 tens plus 2 tens plus 1 ten plus 1 ten,

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:35.490
that's going to give us 7 tens.

00:02:35.490 --> 00:02:38.440
And then we can add this other part

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:43.440
where we see 5 plus 2 is 7 plus 6 is 13.

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:48.470
So it's 70 plus 13.

00:02:48.470 --> 00:02:50.700
Now, what is 70 plus 13?

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:52.410
Well, I could rewrite 13.

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:56.110
I could do something similar as 10 plus 3,

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:58.310
And that makes it a
little bit more obvious.

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:01.490
We can see that that's the
same thing as 70 plus 10,

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:04.970
which is 80 plus 3,

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:07.840
which is the same thing
as 8 tens and 3 ones,

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:10.973
which is equal to 83.

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:13.673
And we're done.

